{"id":"vod_bf_45869","vodId":"45869","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"只要可爱即使是变态你也会喜欢我吧？","name_cn":"只要可爱即使是变态你也会喜欢我吧？","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/35db7e5e4d463af8eda637ec2cfa9562.jpg"},"summary":"桐生慧辉（下野纮 配音）是一个平凡的高中二年级男生，虽然也憧憬着高中校园里甜甜的恋爱，但是这样的恋爱似乎和他无缘。一天，慧辉终于收到一封梦寐以求的情书，然而让他没有想到的是，从信封里竟然掉出了一条白色内裤，难道，寄出这封情书的女孩是一个变态？更糟糕的是，这封情书并没有署名，这也就意味着，活跃在慧辉身边的所有女孩子，都有可能是这封情书的作者。　　看似高高在上实际上是一个受虐狂的朱鹭原纱雪（竹达彩奈 配音）、外表乖巧可爱但是个性却超级恶劣的古贺唯花（日高里菜 配音）、名为漫画家却只画BL漫画的南条真绪（野水伊织 配音），那封情书的作者究竟是谁呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:15:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhiyaokeaijishishibiantainiyehuixihuanwoba/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2